<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38947" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prō^prĭĕtas</span></b> ,
			ātis, f.
		proprius. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>a property</i>, <i>peculiarity</i>, <i>peculiar
			nature</i>, <i>quality</i> of a thing (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">singularum rerum singulae proprietates,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Ac. 2, 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terrae caelique,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					38, 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">definitio genere declaratur, et proprietate
					quādam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Part. 12, 41</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frugum proprietates,</span>”
				<i>peculiar kinds</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					45, 30</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 13, 22, 41, § 121</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">linguae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Gen. 31, 47</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>Ownership</i>, <i>right of
			possession</i>, <i>property</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jumenti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Galb. 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Salaminae insulae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Just. 2,
					7</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Dig. 47, 2, 47</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">proprietatis dominus,</span>”
				<i>proprietor</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">ib. 7, 1, 13, § 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nuda,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gai. Inst. 2, 30</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Dig. 7, 4, 2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>proper
			signification</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">verborum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 8, 2, 1 sq.</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">10, 1, 21</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">12, 2, 19</span></i>; 1
			prooem. 16; 5, 14, 34.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
